{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A collection of tools to quickly create useful models as either STEP, STL, or DXF for 3D printing, CNC, and laser cutting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With an intuitive interface and streamlined tools, create complex parametric models quickly and easily, without the complexity of traditional CAD software.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grid Generator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grid Row</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gridfinity Baseplate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gridfinity Box</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rectangle Steps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Circle Steps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hexagon Grid</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkerboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Circle Pattern</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polygon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vase</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Star</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Braille</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STEP Rotator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STEP to STL</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lissajous</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QR</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Makerchip QR</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle Cube</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living Hinge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D Printing Calculator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test Fit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divider</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slicer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Text</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >File Viewer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Size Comparison</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pyramid</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pegboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cable Clip</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cable Hang</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pipe Adaptor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hook</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squeezer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hole Image</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jig</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STL Decimation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double Text</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel Layers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swatch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SVG to 3D</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More tools and features are in the works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3565810?t=1761602833","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565810/3b533e1855fc9df0d8796a07e237294ddbfeb7e8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761602833","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565810/2fe4209786e3e41575b0bfa1a4d8d30ed5672d57/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761602833","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565810/2fe4209786e3e41575b0bfa1a4d8d30ed5672d57/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761602833","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A collection of tools to quickly create useful models as either STEP, STL, or DXF for 3D printing, CNC, and laser cutting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With an intuitive interface and streamlined tools, create complex parametric models quickly and easily, without the complexity of traditional CAD software.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grid Generator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grid Row</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gridfinity Baseplate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gridfinity Box</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rectangle Steps</p></li><li><p 